2026-09-12T11:10:52.2764873Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-09-12T11:10:52.2765378Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-09-12T11:10:52.2765766Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
